OL,3,GNEWSABeavers boost environment more
OL,4,Athan predicted, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeavers are even better for the
OL,7,Fenvironment than first thought,
OL,8,Faccording to new research from the
OL,9,FUniversity of Liverpool.
OL,11,FA study found the animals helped to
OL,12,Fkeep water levels constant, making
OL,13,Fareas more resistant to drought.
OL,15,FIt adds weight to the claim that more
OL,16,Fbeavers should be re-introduced into
OL,17,Fthe wild, rather than into enclosures.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
