OL,3,GNEWSABeavers boost environment more
OL,4,Athan predicted, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report's author Dr Melanie Baker,
OL,7,Fwhose research was based on a beaver
OL,8,Fenclosure in Hatchmere in Cheshire,
OL,9,Fsaid while the mammals could sometimes
OL,10,Fbuild dams in the wrong places, the
OL,11,Fbenefits outweighed the negatives.
